&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in crypto, payments, corporate treasury, venture capital, or digital assets more broadly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep enthusiasm for fintech, blockchain, and advancing the digital asset industry forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong network in the digital asset industry and track record of building and leveraging relationships to drive revenue opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial background and proven commercial experience, including building a compelling business case with revenue/profit models.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
