&lt;p&gt;Connecting exchanges, OTC desks, custodians, and wallets, the Fireblocks Network settles trillions in crypto trading volume, and delivers a seamless trading experience by reducing friction, unlocking capital efficiency and mitigating counterparty risk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Network Platform team is responsible for developing and maintaining robust and scalable infrastructure components used by Network applications across Fireblocks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Network platform team leader, you will play a pivotal role in shaping the infrastructure of Fireblocks network with defining architecture, patterns and processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and Mentor:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage a team of talented engineers, set technical direction, and provide hands-on mentorship to drive professional growth and high-quality delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Impact Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Take full ownership of Fireblocks’ core Network systems, leading a high-impact domain with real influence on architecture, scalability, and long-term technical direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the development of foundational components and building blocks that support scale, performance, and a wide variety of Network use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Orientation:&lt;/strong&gt; Understand a broad range of platform requirements and work closely with multiple product teams to define and execute the team’s roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration and Knowledge Sharing:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with cross-functional teams, and lead workshops and technical sessions to share knowledge, insights, and best practices across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the availability, reliability, and operational excellence of Network platform components, ensuring the highest level of stability in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of management experience leading engineering teams, preferably on high-scale products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of hands-on experience in backend or full-stack development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BSc in Computer Science or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in designing distributed systems for scale, performance, and resiliency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to define technical direction, lead complex roadmaps, and grow senior engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with external providers, including customer-facing collaboration and cross-functional teamwork.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in TypeScript and/or C++ is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
