&lt;li&gt;Understand what reports finance teams require, when they are needed, and how underlying data must be structured&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage confidently with accounting stakeholders using their language, frameworks, and priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply practical understanding of how digital asset activity impacts accounting treatment, controls, and auditability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This fluency is foundational to credibility in the role and essential to positioning TRES Finance as software purpose-built for finance teams operating in digital asset environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Digital Asset &amp;amp; Platform Knowledge&lt;/h4&gt;
