&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of end-to-end feature development, requiring coding proficiency across the entire backend stack. This includes developing and optimizing core backend components and APIs, as well as associated logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage in close, cross-functional collaboration with Product Managers to define requirements and roadmaps, with Design teams to ensure optimal user experience, and with fellow Engineering teams to execute complex projects, ensuring timely delivery of high-quality, top-tier technical solutions that meet business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively enhance, optimize, and refactor existing production systems and products, focusing on improving performance, reducing technical debt, increasing scalability, and strengthening security and stability, driving a culture of continuous improvement and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
