&lt;li&gt;Research and prototype new blockchain features including Layer 2 solutions, cross-chain bridges, and DeFi protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement secure, scalable blockchain solutions that integrate with Fireblocks&#39; existing infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the company&#39;s interests and provide structured feedback to foundations on protocol design, tooling, and support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for features or changes that would benefit the wallet infrastructure and its users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish strong partnerships with blockchain foundations, vendors,,builders, and customers to address challenges, implement solutions, and ensure we are building the right blockchain integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product, engineering, and security teams to define technical requirements for blockchain initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and guide other engineers on blockchain technologies and implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with emerging blockchain technologies, protocols, and industry developments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of backend development experience in modern languages (Go, Python, JavaScript/TypeScript)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills and a collaborative mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of consensus mechanisms, cryptographic primitives, and distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of microservices architecture and API design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in cross-functional teams and fast-paced environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
