&lt;li&gt;Strong experience building ETL/ELT pipelines using tools like DBT, Airflow, or similar orchestration frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python or another programming language for data processing.&lt;/li&gt;
