&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud platforms, preferably AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to design and maintain reliable, scalable data systems with a strong focus on data quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and the ability to work effectively with both technical and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with fintech, financial services, or cryptocurrency/blockchain - advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
