&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You care about delightful user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a creative thinker with a passion for solving complex engineering challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can clearly communicate your decision making process and engineering choices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a natural curiosity and drive to continuously learn new technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have opinions about the latest technological trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an excellent product sense.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in a collaborative environment and excel as both a project leader and a team player.&lt;/li&gt;
