&lt;li data-start=&quot;2697&quot; data-end=&quot;2819&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2699&quot; data-end=&quot;2819&quot;&gt;Support discussions with regulators, external counsel, and internal stakeholders on product-related regulatory matters&lt;/p&gt;
