&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The world of digital assets is accelerating in speed, magnitude, and complexity, opening the door to new ways for leveraging the blockchain. Fireblocks’ platform and network provide the simplest and most secure way for companies to work with digital assets and it trusted by some of the largest financial institutions, banks, globally-recognized brands, and Web3 companies in the world, including BNY Mellon, BNP Paribas, ANZ Bank, Revolut, and thousands more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fireblocks.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fireblocks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;, the industry-leading digital asset infrastructure technology company responsible for 15% of all crypto transactions!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s the bit about us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fireblocks is an enterprise-grade platform delivering a secure infrastructure for moving, storing, and issuing digital assets &amp;amp; cryptocurrencies. Here at Fireblocks, we enable every business to securely build, run and scale digital asset operations through the Fireblocks Network and MPC-based Wallet Infrastructure. Digital assets are protected from cyber-attacks, internal collusion, and human error using next-generation multi-layer technology. Fireblocks is the only platform that provides insurance for digital assets in storage, transfer, and E&amp;amp;O.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As of August 2025, we serve over 2400 institutional customers, have secured the transfer of over $10 trillion in digital assets, and are the world&#39;s highest-valued digital asset infrastructure company, with over $1 billion raised.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our mission is simple: Enable every business to easily and securely support digital assets &amp;amp; cryptocurrencies. Come join us as we &lt;em&gt;Secure. Simplify. Scale&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fireblocks is looking for a Senior Motion Designer to help bring our brand to life through animation and video. This role sits within the Brand team and is responsible for defining how motion – across animation and live-action video – expresses the Fireblocks identity across marketing, web, events, and product experiences. Through motion, you will help connect our product, our story, and our technology into a cohesive and recognizable brand system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll play a key role in building a scalable motion language for Fireblocks, translating complex, infrastructure-level technology into clear and compelling motion graphics that feel distinctly Fireblocks. This is a highly collaborative role, working closely with brand, product, marketing, and content to ensure motion unifies the entire Fireblocks ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and build Fireblocks’ &lt;strong&gt;brand motion system&lt;/strong&gt;, including a scalable &lt;strong&gt;brand motion kit&lt;/strong&gt; that brings our visual identity to life across touchpoints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and produce motion assets for brand campaigns, product launches, web experiences, events, and social&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create &lt;strong&gt;UI and product animations for web&lt;/strong&gt;, including micro-interactions, transitions, and storytelling moments (experience with Lottie animations is required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create &lt;strong&gt;product demo and instructional-style videos&lt;/strong&gt;, simplifying complex workflows and features through motion graphics and clear visual storytelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce &lt;strong&gt;live-action video edits&lt;/strong&gt;, including high-production interviews, customer stories, founder-led storytelling, and brand narratives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish motion principles, documentation, and guidelines to ensure consistency and quality at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in motion design, animation, or video production, ideally within the tech industry *&lt;em&gt;portfolio required*&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert proficiency in Adobe After Effects and Premiere Pro, with interest or experience in Ai-first motion tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of motion principles, pacing, and storytelling—across both animation and live-action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience creating Lottie animations optimized for web performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to simplify complex or technical products into clear, instructional, and engaging visuals through motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills, with the ability to partner cross-functionally and present work clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High bar for craft, polish, and design quality, paired with the ability to move quickly and iterate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of current design trends, history, and techniques that will help elevate our brand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For employees hired to work from our NYC HQ, Fireblocks is required by law to include a reasonable estimate of the compensation range for this role. This range is specific to New York City and takes into consideration a wide range of factors that are reviewed when making a hiring decision, such as years of experience, skills, and other business needs. It is not typical for a candidate to be hired at or near the top of the pay range and each compensation decision is dependent on each individual case. A reasonable base salary range estimate for this position is $125,000 - $170,000. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary is one component of the total compensation package, which for some roles may include a target bonus, a very competitive equity grant, and very generous benefits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;While we believe competitive compensation is a critical aspect of your decision to join us, we do hope you also spend time considering why our mission and culture are right for you. We are creating something transformational here, and we hope you are as excited about the future as we are.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
