&lt;li&gt;Experience with Coding languages - Python/JavaScript/Bash (Must)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 3+ years of experience with Alerting &amp;amp; Monitoring systems such as &lt;strong&gt;DataDog&lt;/strong&gt; Coralogix / Splunk / New Relic / Prometheus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Linux systems from kernel to shell and beyond&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud systems such as &lt;strong&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt; / Google cloud / Azure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configuration management such as &lt;strong&gt;Ansible&lt;/strong&gt;/Chef/Puppet/ArgoCD&lt;/li&gt;
