&lt;li&gt;SCM - Git/bitbucket/&lt;strong&gt;gitlab&lt;/strong&gt;/Phabricator/gerrit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High Analytical &amp;amp; Troubleshooting skills - ability to solve complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills and a collaborative mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
