&lt;li&gt;Ensuring Operational Excellence and engaging with top customers to deliver high-quality service&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on Customer Satisfaction, Productivity, Training of TAC &amp;amp; TAM, and Employee retention &amp;amp; Growth&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
