&lt;li&gt;Providing overall leadership to managers and staff to adhere to processes, procedures, and policies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with various teams such as Product, R&amp;amp;D, Customer Success, and Services to manage specific customer needs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tracking Key Performance Indicators (KPIs) such as Initial Time to Response, Avg Time to resolution, Backlog Management, and CSAT results&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
