&lt;li&gt;Working on escalated issues with the R&amp;amp;D(Engineering) team and providing advanced troubleshooting support&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing mentorship and guidance on technical and non-technical issues as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
