&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing cross-functional programs, in a fast-paced environment and the ability to manage multiple projects and priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong professional presence and confidence working with and advising entry-level through top executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong work ethic, integrity, and organizational skills&lt;/li&gt;
